WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:53.886 --> 00:01:00.302
Mother, please don't say anything to aunt.

00:01:03.345 --> 00:01:04.405
My child

00:01:04.954 --> 00:01:06.303
almost died.

00:01:09.341 --> 00:01:12.530
Asifa is responsible for her condition.

00:01:12.556 --> 00:01:15.325
She hurt her and then came to help
her too.

00:01:15.887 --> 00:01:17.707
She is such a cheap woman.

00:01:20.456 --> 00:01:27.529
Look mother, if Raja has refused the proposal, then what is aunt's or anyboy's fault in this?

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:31.152
I understand what you are trying to say.

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:36.164
No child is so stubborn.

00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:42.638
If Asifa had wanted, then Raja would have
come to marry her.

00:01:43.705 --> 00:01:45.258
So would that make Saba happy?

00:01:49.454 --> 00:01:53.114
Relationships made by force do not last
long, mother.

00:01:55.216 --> 00:01:56.736
I am Saba's brother.

00:01:58.074 --> 00:02:01.766
I have seen her in blood in these hands.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.387
The hands in which I have fed her.

00:02:05.329 --> 00:02:07.018
Mother, will I think bad of her?

00:02:09.085 --> 00:02:10.105
Mother, please.

00:02:10.485 --> 00:02:11.985
Please mother, stop it.

00:02:13.887 --> 00:02:15.892
Don't put more focus on this topic.

00:02:18.287 --> 00:02:20.047
Amir is right, Inayat.

00:02:22.263 --> 00:02:26.214
Let us not lose our daughter in our
stubbornness.

00:02:30.744 --> 00:02:33.941
Look, in the part of
life where she is, in

00:02:33.966 --> 00:02:36.837
that part, a person
makes a lot of mistakes.

00:02:38.732 --> 00:02:45.235
And in the part where we are, we cannot
ignore those mistakes.

00:02:47.228 --> 00:02:51.141
In fact, we will have to correct those
mistakes of our children.

00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:52.646
We will have to make them understand.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:03:01.702
Instead of supporting them in destroying 
their own lives.

00:03:07.786 --> 00:03:09.924
Think about her with a cool heart.

00:03:15.215 --> 00:03:16.615
What is wrong with her?

00:03:16.887 --> 00:03:18.398
What nonsense is she doing?

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.791
She liked you since childhood.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.616
You are abandoning her after getting
engaged with her.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.993
Did you think she would happily say yes?

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:31.019
I have made her understand.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.068
I have told her everything.

00:03:32.093 --> 00:03:32.706
But still she...

00:03:33.781 --> 00:03:35.159
I don't understand girls.

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:37.603
When she doesn't like someone,
she doesn't like them at all.

00:03:37.641 --> 00:03:39.578
But if she likes someone, she gives her
life for him.

00:03:42.246 --> 00:03:43.668
How much did I make you understand?

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.049
Me?

00:03:45.073 --> 00:03:46.073
Mother?

00:03:47.237 --> 00:03:48.237
Did you understand?

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:50.960
No, right?

00:03:54.153 --> 00:03:55.259
Us girls...

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.993
We are really crazy.

00:04:01.215 --> 00:04:02.575
If we consider someone as our own.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.717
Then we are left being only theirs.

00:04:07.477 --> 00:04:10.651
And then we think that all our dreams will
be fulfilled.

00:04:11.648 --> 00:04:12.648
Saira...

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:14.653
Raja...

00:04:15.717 --> 00:04:17.139
Where are you both?

00:04:17.976 --> 00:04:18.736
Come on now.

00:04:19.075 --> 00:04:20.146
We are here, mother.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.308
Where are you going?

00:04:47.692 --> 00:04:48.593
University.

00:04:48.866 --> 00:04:49.639
I go there every day.

00:04:50.462 --> 00:04:53.222
You have made us so crazy behind the
name of university.

00:04:54.371 --> 00:04:55.131
You won't go.

00:04:56.013 --> 00:04:57.573
Who are you to stop me?

00:04:58.251 --> 00:04:59.042
Your brother.

00:04:59.797 --> 00:05:00.868
I don't consider you as my brother.

00:05:01.398 --> 00:05:02.189
Look, Raniya.

00:05:02.697 --> 00:05:04.475
I don't want to misbehave with you.

00:05:06.366 --> 00:05:07.686
You won't go to university today.

00:05:08.911 --> 00:05:09.471
Fine.

00:05:09.603 --> 00:05:10.735
I will tell Adil.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.208
You guys won't let me go to university.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:13.539
Fine.

00:05:13.977 --> 00:05:16.306
I will also tell him what you are up to.

00:05:16.893 --> 00:05:17.702
I will also tell him.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:05:59.800
Yes, Raja.

00:05:59.824 --> 00:06:00.299
What happened?

00:06:01.282 --> 00:06:02.282
I need your help.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.130
Yes, tell me.

00:06:05.228 --> 00:06:07.310
Find any way and go to Rania's house.

00:06:07.862 --> 00:06:10.171
Tell her that she and I are getting
married today.

00:06:11.862 --> 00:06:13.708
Tell me what happened.

00:06:13.969 --> 00:06:15.129
I am sending the address.

00:06:15.153 --> 00:06:17.075
Just bring her there somehow.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.386
But you have to do it quickly.

00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:20.251
Okay?

00:06:20.275 --> 00:06:21.101
I will try.

00:06:21.126 --> 00:06:21.726
Just contact her.

00:06:22.039 --> 00:06:22.639
Okay.

00:06:36.932 --> 00:06:37.865
Here you go, mother.

00:06:38.546 --> 00:06:39.326
Give it to me.

00:06:39.567 --> 00:06:40.243
Give it.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.405
I don't understand Raja.

00:06:44.515 --> 00:06:45.809
He leaves the house.

00:06:45.834 --> 00:06:46.794
He comes back.

00:06:47.201 --> 00:06:48.761
I don't know what has happened to him.

00:06:50.289 --> 00:06:51.833
Now Saba is not well.

00:06:51.858 --> 00:06:52.858
She is lying on the bed.

00:06:53.277 --> 00:06:55.388
I had to go to her house to ask about her
health.

00:06:56.004 --> 00:06:59.302
And he has reached in front of me with the
invitation for his wedding.

00:06:59.714 --> 00:07:01.079
He is at that age, mother.

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:04.529
You go easily and keep this from my
side.

00:07:05.278 --> 00:07:07.216
Give it to Rania at the time of the
wedding.

00:07:10.967 --> 00:07:11.530
Give it to me.

00:07:12.276 --> 00:07:13.314
Hey, Raja.

00:07:13.829 --> 00:07:15.077
Where are you?

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:16.337
Come on, I am ready.

00:07:16.441 --> 00:07:17.621
I am coming, mother.

00:07:17.876 --> 00:07:19.747
Come already, 'I am coming'.

00:07:20.252 --> 00:07:21.056
Okay, child. 

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.716
This problem is also your fault.

00:07:25.897 --> 00:07:27.781
Why did you have to tell this to 
your family?

00:07:27.846 --> 00:07:29.106
I made a mistake.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.018
Don't get angry with me like Raja.

00:07:31.289 --> 00:07:32.627
Is there anyone at home?

00:07:32.993 --> 00:07:33.915
No.

00:07:34.131 --> 00:07:35.131
There is no one at home.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:36.725
Okay, do it quickly.

00:07:37.477 --> 00:07:38.061
What should I do?

00:07:38.312 --> 00:07:39.026
I should change right?

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:39.752
Yes, quickly.

00:07:39.976 --> 00:07:40.674
Okay.

00:07:42.025 --> 00:07:42.647
What should I wear? 

00:07:42.994 --> 00:07:44.509
My mother, wear anything.

00:07:44.543 --> 00:07:45.310
Please, do it quickly.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.174
My hands and feet are swollen because of
you.

00:07:50.281 --> 00:07:51.281
Towel.

00:07:53.738 --> 00:07:54.738
Quickly.

00:07:54.947 --> 00:07:56.187
We are getting late.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.091
How much more will I have to wait?

00:08:17.342 --> 00:08:19.305
Lawyer, they must be coming.

00:08:19.752 --> 00:08:20.792
Shall I order tea for you?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.460
I have already had five cups of tea.

00:08:23.519 --> 00:08:24.773
How many more will you make me drink?

00:08:24.962 --> 00:08:26.793
I had an appearance at court today!

00:08:26.916 --> 00:08:28.858
Oh sorry, lawyer.

00:08:29.287 --> 00:08:31.296
Please have another cup of tea in my love.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.728
He will also come in that time.

00:08:33.511 --> 00:08:34.364
Is he okay?

00:08:34.669 --> 00:08:36.998
Are the couple running away and getting married?

00:08:38.519 --> 00:08:40.211
What shall I tell you, lawyer.

00:08:41.025 --> 00:08:43.731
In this cruel society,
whenever there is a

00:08:43.755 --> 00:08:48.949
conflict between lovers,
we need people like you.

00:08:49.777 --> 00:08:50.360
Wow.

00:08:51.766 --> 00:08:52.300
Love?

00:08:53.021 --> 00:08:53.958
Love marriage?

00:08:54.199 --> 00:08:56.675
Of course, that's why we are here to serve
you.

00:08:57.089 --> 00:09:00.036
Is it love or is it a matter of love?

00:09:01.739 --> 00:09:05.808
Since when has love and love become
separate?

00:09:06.079 --> 00:09:09.818
Look, if it's just a
matter of love and love,

00:09:09.843 --> 00:09:12.745
then mobile technology
becomes lovey-lovey.

00:09:13.014 --> 00:09:14.441
There are also wedding charges.

00:09:14.894 --> 00:09:18.035
Now it's up to you whether to ask for tea
or not.

00:09:19.455 --> 00:09:23.384
And if it's love, then what?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:30.547
On one hand, love is a book of letters, a
couplet, a diary, an unaccepted confession.

00:09:30.985 --> 00:09:35.831
Oh, this is the story of our Raja Rani.

00:09:36.459 --> 00:09:38.457
Raja Rani can't get married.

00:09:38.834 --> 00:09:39.834
I'm sitting here.

00:09:40.224 --> 00:09:41.231
You can ask for tea.

00:09:41.415 --> 00:09:43.444
What nonsense are you talking,
lawyer?

00:09:43.889 --> 00:09:44.620
Can't get married.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.740
Why can't they get married?

00:09:46.254 --> 00:09:48.442
They both truly love each other.

00:09:48.829 --> 00:09:53.519
When you fall in love, then the whole
universe starts to trap you.

00:09:54.701 --> 00:09:56.046
Now ask for tea.

00:09:57.496 --> 00:09:58.318
Bring it.

00:09:59.026 --> 00:09:59.495
Go.

00:09:59.653 --> 00:10:00.933
Keep the sugar less.

00:10:03.526 --> 00:10:04.833
The tea is very sweet.

00:11:14.145 --> 00:11:16.590
Did you only call to confirm this news?

00:11:17.392 --> 00:11:18.227
Aunt!

00:11:18.398 --> 00:11:19.625
Okay, I will talk to you later.

00:11:22.805 --> 00:11:23.930
What is all this? 

00:11:24.514 --> 00:11:26.067
Who informed the media?

00:11:26.629 --> 00:11:28.226
I am worried myself.

00:11:28.959 --> 00:11:30.141
I have no idea.

00:11:31.441 --> 00:11:32.798
I have sent Sikandar. 

00:11:33.475 --> 00:11:37.478
To talk to the social media team
about how this news went viral.

00:11:53.006 --> 00:11:54.519
Yes, Ms. Maria.

00:11:57.649 --> 00:11:58.183
What?

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.783
But this news went viral only on social
media.

00:12:05.376 --> 00:12:07.354
How can Adil be interviewed?

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:12.074
Look please, you need to be a little
sensitive.

00:12:13.143 --> 00:12:14.803
We also support you a lot.

00:12:48.627 --> 00:12:49.524
You look beautiful.

00:12:50.677 --> 00:12:51.477
Thanks.

00:12:52.559 --> 00:12:53.202
Thank you.

00:12:53.499 --> 00:12:54.059
Come.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.500
Greetings.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.888
Greetings.

00:13:08.175 --> 00:13:09.396
You look very pretty.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.355
Very pretty.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.380
Thank you, aunty.

00:13:11.471 --> 00:13:14.799
Look at me, I forgot.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.755
Aunty, what is the need for them?

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.082
There is a need.

00:13:25.993 --> 00:13:27.333
From today, these are yours.

00:13:27.415 --> 00:13:27.755
Here.

00:13:28.631 --> 00:13:29.631
In the name of God.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.660
Oh, be careful.

00:13:32.684 --> 00:13:33.184
Don't hurt her.

00:13:33.736 --> 00:13:35.504
How much are you worried about your hands?

00:13:36.635 --> 00:13:38.120
I am putting them comfortably.

00:13:38.144 --> 00:13:39.051
Don't worry.

00:13:39.699 --> 00:13:41.386
My daughter has very delicate hands.

00:13:41.494 --> 00:13:42.212
In the name of God.

00:13:42.236 --> 00:13:43.076
In the name of God.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:43.864
Wow.

00:13:43.977 --> 00:13:46.148
You look very pretty.

00:13:46.173 --> 00:13:47.084
Very pretty.

00:13:48.222 --> 00:13:49.222
Lawyer.

00:13:53.699 --> 00:13:54.699
Lawyer.

00:13:55.951 --> 00:13:57.311
The groom and bridegroom are here.

00:13:57.355 --> 00:13:59.472
I was saying, get them signed on the
papers.

00:13:59.497 --> 00:14:01.719
Then let's go to the court to do the rest
of the work.

00:14:06.187 --> 00:14:07.187
Lawyer.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.378
The groom and bridegroom are here.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.297
Rania Mirza.

00:14:34.662 --> 00:14:36.102
This marriage cannot take place.

00:14:38.088 --> 00:14:38.993
What are you saying?

00:14:41.206 --> 00:14:42.226
How is this marriage?

00:14:43.116 --> 00:14:44.596
What are you saying?

00:14:45.126 --> 00:14:46.126
You have taken money.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:47.577
And you have drunk tea for ten times.

00:14:47.601 --> 00:14:49.316
And you are saying that marriage cannot
take place?

00:14:49.691 --> 00:14:50.411
Oh, brother.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.698
This is the money for your fees.

00:14:55.704 --> 00:14:57.395
And this is the money for your tea.

00:14:58.724 --> 00:15:00.244
I am not going to come in this matter.

00:15:00.309 --> 00:15:01.681
Oh, lawyer.

00:15:01.706 --> 00:15:02.940
What happened all of a sudden?

00:15:02.941 --> 00:15:05.012
Why are you refusing to get them married?

00:15:06.993 --> 00:15:09.273
The angel of death can kill all
of a sudden.

00:15:10.128 --> 00:15:12.179
The marriage of Adil Sultan's fiancée.

00:15:12.966 --> 00:15:14.686
No one can do it in this city.

00:15:14.951 --> 00:15:15.671
Lawyer?

00:15:16.017 --> 00:15:17.533
No judge will come here either.

00:15:18.222 --> 00:15:19.857
Brother, you don't watch social media.

00:15:20.103 --> 00:15:20.971
But I watch it.

00:15:21.755 --> 00:15:22.702
Allow me. 

00:15:24.497 --> 00:15:25.797
Listen to me, uncle.

00:15:26.422 --> 00:15:26.955
Hey.

00:15:35.837 --> 00:15:36.531
Show me.

00:15:38.482 --> 00:15:39.602
What is he saying

00:15:48.034 --> 00:15:49.994
No one can get you married now.

00:15:55.156 --> 00:15:56.156
Yes, brother.

00:15:56.327 --> 00:15:56.892
Come.

00:15:58.065 --> 00:15:58.972
Yes, dad.

00:16:01.163 --> 00:16:04.036
What is this company in which these
amounts are going?

00:16:04.186 --> 00:16:06.266
-Projects are ours and...
-Leave that.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.290
I will take care of it.

00:16:08.652 --> 00:16:09.296
You.

00:16:10.541 --> 00:16:11.363
Look at this.

00:16:17.391 --> 00:16:19.591
The wedding talks of Adil and Rania 
are going on everywhere.

00:16:41.222 --> 00:16:43.586
And the good thing is that Adil himself is
here.

00:16:45.364 --> 00:16:47.268
If Raja does any mistake.

00:16:49.893 --> 00:16:51.364
Then Adil will deal with it himself.

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:57.784
But...

00:16:59.677 --> 00:17:01.257
You have to do one thing, dad.

00:17:05.376 --> 00:17:07.567
As soon as Adil's family comes to our
house.

00:17:08.827 --> 00:17:10.605
You have to give him the wedding dates.

00:17:46.143 --> 00:17:47.236
Okay, you don't worry.

00:17:47.796 --> 00:17:48.979
There is a religious scholar here.

00:17:49.004 --> 00:17:50.128
I will talk to him.

00:17:50.153 --> 00:17:51.766
He will get us married in a day or two.

00:17:52.519 --> 00:17:54.105
Raja, I will get married, right?

00:17:54.397 --> 00:17:55.046
Why not?

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:55.941
It will happen.

00:17:56.465 --> 00:17:58.069
Adil is back.

00:17:58.665 --> 00:17:59.665
For a while now.

00:17:59.994 --> 00:18:01.750
He was not telling anyone about the
engagement.

00:18:01.774 --> 00:18:03.174
Today he posted it on social media.

00:18:05.498 --> 00:18:06.874
Raja, I am very scared.

00:18:06.898 --> 00:18:07.733
Something is not right.

00:18:08.205 --> 00:18:08.945
Don't be scared.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:09.970
It's not like that.

00:18:10.374 --> 00:18:10.994
I am here.

00:18:11.112 --> 00:18:11.786
Don't worry.

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.448
I am here to see everything.

00:18:12.822 --> 00:18:13.602
You don't worry.

00:18:13.626 --> 00:18:14.272
Go home.

00:18:14.375 --> 00:18:15.675
And text me when you reach home.

00:18:15.699 --> 00:18:15.918
Okay?

00:18:16.148 --> 00:18:16.579
You go.

00:18:17.252 --> 00:18:18.118
Take care of yourself.

00:18:40.264 --> 00:18:42.544
Bablu bhai, in this entire city, you only
found this idiot?

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:43.880
Law.

00:18:43.931 --> 00:18:44.931
What bloody law?

00:18:45.942 --> 00:18:51.717
Son, the law which you are talking about, the seats that make those laws,

00:18:51.742 --> 00:18:53.959
one of them is of Adil Sultan.

00:18:54.975 --> 00:18:57.311
Anyone would have done this instead of
him.

00:19:20.269 --> 00:19:21.416
What's wrong, mom?

00:19:22.164 --> 00:19:24.591
You've been sitting like this since you
came.

00:19:25.658 --> 00:19:26.709
At least say something.

00:19:28.609 --> 00:19:29.849
What are you thinking?

00:19:33.224 --> 00:19:36.184
Raja and Rania getting married and
stopping like this.

00:19:36.935 --> 00:19:38.675
It is not a good omen, Saira.

00:19:40.399 --> 00:19:42.560
My heart is already very worried.

00:19:43.475 --> 00:19:44.362
You know, right?

00:19:45.664 --> 00:19:47.753
Adil has also returned to Pakistan.

00:19:50.762 --> 00:19:52.686
This is a worrying matter.

00:19:54.039 --> 00:19:56.336
You remember Mirza, right?

00:19:56.802 --> 00:19:59.021
The one who entered our house in a hurry.

00:19:59.617 --> 00:20:03.596
He must have told Adil about Raja and
Rania for sure.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.920
Oh God, these people are so dangerous.

00:20:08.446 --> 00:20:10.068
What do I do?

00:20:10.497 --> 00:20:12.524
What problem have I got into?

00:20:17.746 --> 00:20:19.126
Don't worry, mom.

00:20:21.577 --> 00:20:22.886
Raja and Rania...

00:20:24.437 --> 00:20:25.644
their intentions are clear.

00:20:27.777 --> 00:20:29.077
And their love is true.

00:20:31.222 --> 00:20:33.842
God is with true hearted people.

00:20:38.834 --> 00:20:40.016
You don't worry.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:40.963
Everything will be fine.

00:20:40.988 --> 00:20:41.846
I am sure of it.

00:20:42.748 --> 00:20:43.388
Okay.

00:20:45.731 --> 00:20:47.242
I'll make tea for you.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:49.998
Make tea.

00:20:50.347 --> 00:20:50.676
And...

00:20:51.232 --> 00:20:52.732
give me Rania's number.

00:20:52.756 --> 00:20:54.036
I'll talk to her over the phone.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.784
I don't know how the girl is doing.

00:21:16.921 --> 00:21:17.516
Rania?

00:21:18.625 --> 00:21:19.270
What is this?

00:21:19.678 --> 00:21:21.203
You are still sitting like this?

00:21:21.874 --> 00:21:22.856
You haven't even changed.

00:21:23.244 --> 00:21:23.901
What do you mean?

00:21:23.925 --> 00:21:24.685
Don't you want to go home?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.141
Yes.

00:21:26.309 --> 00:21:27.309
I'll change.

00:21:29.806 --> 00:21:30.286
Okay.

00:21:30.443 --> 00:21:31.426
You drink tea.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.223
It's getting cold.

00:21:32.554 --> 00:21:33.204
I'll be back.

00:21:33.278 --> 00:21:33.798
Okay?

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.047
Hello, aunt.

00:21:42.792 --> 00:21:43.812
How are you, dear?

00:21:46.914 --> 00:21:47.505
I am fine.

00:21:48.548 --> 00:21:49.548
Look, dear.

00:21:49.572 --> 00:21:51.187
What happened was not good.

00:21:51.788 --> 00:21:54.765
Every girl has some desires in her heart.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.230
Some dreams.

00:21:56.946 --> 00:21:59.426
If you open your eyes from those dreams,
your heart becomes bad.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:00.285
Right, dear?

00:22:03.065 --> 00:22:05.409
Sometimes, a person gets angry.

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:12.491
Aunty, the girls who don't have a mother,
their dreams get fulfilled with difficulty.

00:22:13.378 --> 00:22:13.858
Hey!

00:22:14.401 --> 00:22:16.554
What kind of silly thing are you saying?

00:22:17.281 --> 00:22:18.387
I am there.

00:22:18.673 --> 00:22:19.415
Your mother.

00:22:20.727 --> 00:22:22.996
And I will never listen to such things
again.

00:22:24.763 --> 00:22:26.083
Anyway, my child.

00:22:26.507 --> 00:22:28.883
Both of you have chosen a very difficult
path.

00:22:29.729 --> 00:22:31.614
There will be thorns in this path.

00:22:32.712 --> 00:22:33.103
And...

00:22:34.472 --> 00:22:36.352
It is possible that you might even find a
stone.

00:22:39.138 --> 00:22:41.101
You will have to strengthen your heart.

00:22:41.745 --> 00:22:44.005
Otherwise, how will you continue your
journey, dear?

00:22:45.234 --> 00:22:46.286
And you tell me.

00:22:46.782 --> 00:22:47.856
How are you?

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:48.551
Where are you?

00:22:48.575 --> 00:22:49.994
Have you eaten or not?

00:22:51.812 --> 00:22:53.232
I am at Erum's house right now.

00:22:54.365 --> 00:22:55.365
I haven't eaten.

00:22:55.496 --> 00:22:56.683
I will go home and eat.

00:22:57.727 --> 00:22:59.127
Go home, dear.

00:23:00.276 --> 00:23:03.361
In this way, your father will get even
more worried.

00:23:04.198 --> 00:23:05.198
Okay, aunty.

00:23:05.494 --> 00:23:06.121
I will leave now.

00:23:07.045 --> 00:23:07.770
Good bye.

00:23:08.268 --> 00:23:09.733
God bless you, my child.

00:23:09.758 --> 00:23:10.447
Good bye.

00:23:30.935 --> 00:23:36.541
Adil, I was thinking that when this
marriage thing is everywhere.

00:23:37.389 --> 00:23:40.852
And you have already engaged, then what is
the harm in getting married?

00:23:42.767 --> 00:23:48.834
And we hid the engagement thing from Rania
because her life was in danger. 

00:23:50.109 --> 00:23:53.027
I was thinking that that when she gets
married and comes back to this house,

00:23:53.963 --> 00:23:56.654
then her security problem will be solved,
right?

00:23:57.941 --> 00:23:59.312
She will be safe here.

00:24:03.957 --> 00:24:04.806
Where were you?

00:24:05.127 --> 00:24:06.487
I've been calling you for so long.

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:08.812
Did you find out who did all this?

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:10.565
No.

00:24:11.747 --> 00:24:12.905
But I found out something else.

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:18.826
The team you hired for uncle's case,
they told me that on the day of uncle's

00:24:18.851 --> 00:24:21.385
martyrdom, the number
Rehmat Ali was getting

00:24:21.386 --> 00:24:24.111
a call from, that number
was in Fareed's name.

00:24:30.190 --> 00:24:31.832
I already had a doubt about that.

00:24:32.552 --> 00:24:33.246
Where is Rehmat Ali?

00:24:33.270 --> 00:24:33.936
Pick him up.

00:24:36.254 --> 00:24:36.969
He is missing.

00:24:38.776 --> 00:24:39.292
Missing?

00:24:46.530 --> 00:24:52.563
Adil, I am telling you, you should get
married.

00:24:56.478 --> 00:24:59.003
These investigations will continue.

00:25:01.318 --> 00:25:02.983
You also deserve to be happy.

00:25:05.043 --> 00:25:06.765
You should get some relief.

00:25:10.797 --> 00:25:11.286
Huh?

00:25:43.008 --> 00:25:43.533
Hello?

00:25:47.119 --> 00:25:47.551
Hello?

00:25:48.314 --> 00:25:49.360
Your boss is here.

00:25:50.426 --> 00:25:51.048
Did you find out?

00:25:53.073 --> 00:25:54.073
I was just thinking.

00:25:54.980 --> 00:25:56.140
Your call has come.

00:25:57.731 --> 00:25:58.871
The heart has a way with the heart.

00:25:59.531 --> 00:26:02.977
Those who have the same goal, often find
their way too.

00:26:04.911 --> 00:26:05.573
Goal?

00:26:06.180 --> 00:26:08.035
Yes, we have the same goal.

00:26:09.464 --> 00:26:11.026
This market is yours today.

00:26:11.595 --> 00:26:12.708
It used to be ours once.

00:26:13.268 --> 00:26:14.773
My father used to come here.

00:26:16.377 --> 00:26:17.517
These people were ours.

00:26:18.128 --> 00:26:21.328
But then Sultan uncle came and our
relationship broke.

00:26:22.226 --> 00:26:24.113
He cheated these people.

00:26:24.680 --> 00:26:25.680
These are our people.

00:26:26.220 --> 00:26:27.208
They are far away from us.

00:26:28.279 --> 00:26:30.664
I want these people back with votes.

00:26:31.378 --> 00:26:32.178
And you?

00:26:32.202 --> 00:26:34.406
We have to make this market a London
market.

00:26:36.148 --> 00:26:37.417
Is our goal the same?

00:26:40.577 --> 00:26:42.199
The shops will be in our name.

00:26:44.724 --> 00:26:47.137
You must have known how good we are
with our promises.

00:26:49.944 --> 00:26:52.075
You and Rania have kept a secret.

00:26:55.994 --> 00:26:59.354
It is not wrong to cheat a cheater,
Raja.

00:27:02.103 --> 00:27:02.889
We are bad.

00:27:03.865 --> 00:27:04.865
But we are strong.

00:27:49.075 --> 00:27:50.533
How is my child?

00:27:53.499 --> 00:27:54.470
Saba, child.

00:27:59.568 --> 00:28:00.439
Child this...

00:28:01.517 --> 00:28:02.993
what was this act?

00:28:05.651 --> 00:28:09.135
You didn't even think about your father
once.

00:28:11.149 --> 00:28:12.979
What will happen to my heart?

00:28:18.032 --> 00:28:19.964
Forgive me, father.

00:28:22.044 --> 00:28:24.026
I don't know what had happened.

00:28:25.039 --> 00:28:26.757
I couldn't understand anything.

00:28:27.931 --> 00:28:36.552
Son, when you pay attention to things being said to you, you really don't understand anything.

00:28:39.980 --> 00:28:45.311
You don't understand what a person is saying and
what they are doing.

00:28:49.106 --> 00:28:51.068
So child, keep quiet.

00:28:51.275 --> 00:28:52.275
Well done.

00:28:55.809 --> 00:28:58.451
Look, God has given you another life.

00:29:00.195 --> 00:29:01.726
Now you have to value it.

00:29:07.391 --> 00:29:08.544
I will see who it is.

00:29:22.575 --> 00:29:24.002
Raja is not answering his phone.

00:29:25.831 --> 00:29:26.786
Find out where he is.

00:29:40.919 --> 00:29:42.772
I have spoken with an lawyer, don't worry.

00:29:43.574 --> 00:29:45.636
Married this time is sure.

00:29:47.269 --> 00:29:48.829
Last time you did the lawyer too.

00:29:49.558 --> 00:29:50.598
Try this time too.

00:29:51.649 --> 00:29:57.392
Mr. Raja, every child in this city
remembers Rania's face.

00:29:58.776 --> 00:30:02.365
Lawyer, judge, marriage appointer, 
nobody is at fault.

00:30:03.247 --> 00:30:06.254
Who will risk their life for your
marriage.

00:30:07.274 --> 00:30:11.012
So this lawyer that you have chosen,
doesn't he care about his life?

00:30:11.790 --> 00:30:12.407
No.

00:30:13.876 --> 00:30:14.507
Is he a goon?

00:30:15.505 --> 00:30:16.412
No.

00:30:17.559 --> 00:30:18.598
He is a husband, poor guy.

00:30:19.406 --> 00:30:21.708
His wife is sick and he needed money.

00:30:22.221 --> 00:30:27.216
I told him that I will give him whatever
money he asks for.

00:30:27.518 --> 00:30:28.341
He agreed.

00:30:28.910 --> 00:30:30.092
Have you lost your mind?

00:30:30.808 --> 00:30:32.432
I do not have money to eat here.

00:30:32.461 --> 00:30:33.365
I am surviving on hacks..

00:30:33.668 --> 00:30:35.732
You are going and telling others
ask for whatever you want?

00:30:35.757 --> 00:30:36.526
What are you doing?

00:30:36.550 --> 00:30:37.318
You are so strange.

00:30:37.854 --> 00:30:39.607
You are such a strange man.

00:30:40.705 --> 00:30:43.265
You want to love but you don't want to
spend money and your life.

00:30:43.689 --> 00:30:44.849
I have put my life in danger.

00:30:45.263 --> 00:30:46.163
Should I cut off my nerves?

00:30:46.187 --> 00:30:46.466
No.

00:30:46.490 --> 00:30:48.832
Don't do this 90's lover thing.

00:30:49.318 --> 00:30:50.532
"Should I cut my nerves".

00:30:53.185 --> 00:30:56.065
Don't give blood to love.

00:30:56.816 --> 00:30:58.025
Give money.

00:30:58.465 --> 00:30:59.319
Then you will see.

00:30:59.778 --> 00:31:04.098
Heer Ranjha will not only hold hands in their grave
but also out on the streets. 

00:31:06.050 --> 00:31:06.730
Raja.

00:31:07.874 --> 00:31:09.429
Mr. Adil has called you.

00:31:11.859 --> 00:31:12.428
You go.

00:31:12.452 --> 00:31:13.091
I will come in the evening.

00:31:13.174 --> 00:31:13.654
No.

00:31:13.970 --> 00:31:14.525
Right now.

00:31:20.407 --> 00:31:22.221
I have to end this story today.

00:31:34.735 --> 00:31:36.173
Your father was accused right?

00:31:37.782 --> 00:31:39.862
That he took the money for the lease of
Landa Bazaar.

00:31:41.192 --> 00:31:43.202
That money was given to Adil Sultan's
father.

00:31:44.293 --> 00:31:45.737
Which was used in the party funds.

00:31:47.537 --> 00:31:49.653
He accused your poor father.

00:31:50.442 --> 00:31:55.171
Your father used to come and go to  Sultan Ali
Khan's house.

00:31:56.716 --> 00:32:05.088
He told all of us that we should collect
the value of these shops.

00:32:06.238 --> 00:32:06.995
Tell me Raja.

00:32:10.657 --> 00:32:13.469
Is there really no one else in her life
other than me?

00:32:13.978 --> 00:32:14.600
No.

00:32:16.108 --> 00:32:16.891
There is no one.

00:32:20.061 --> 00:32:22.309
I have heard with my
own ears that Rania was

00:32:22.333 --> 00:32:24.245
saying that she has
started to love someone.

00:32:27.415 --> 00:32:28.868
What is wrong with madam?

00:32:30.597 --> 00:32:33.837
She must have done her film or documentary
because some hero likes her.

00:32:35.580 --> 00:32:36.904
Artists are like that.

00:32:42.280 --> 00:32:42.831
Anyway.

00:32:44.613 --> 00:32:45.564
You don't worry.

00:32:46.853 --> 00:32:48.173
You will find anyone.

00:32:53.618 --> 00:32:54.156
Obviously.

00:32:55.763 --> 00:32:59.961
There are many raised in, educated and rich
people in London.

00:33:03.910 --> 00:33:05.167
They look good too.

00:33:06.774 --> 00:33:08.114
There is no lack of anything.

00:33:08.465 --> 00:33:09.474
Absolutely perfect.

00:33:16.944 --> 00:33:18.564
Why would anyone betray you?

